# Rean AI Instant Visual Tutor - Mermaid Flowchart Source

## 1. System Overview
```mermaid
flowchart LR
  S([Student stuck]) --> M[Submit problem: text/photo/upload/voice/work/recent]
  M --> A[Immediate acknowledgement]
  A --> B[Backend creates Tutor Session]
  B --> AI[AI analyzes internally]
  AI --> F[First useful hint/visual/step/question]
  F --> R[Student responds]
  R --> E{Response correct?}
  E -->|Yes| N[Next learning step]
  E -->|Partly| P[Explain missing part and ask revise]
  E -->|No| H[Detect misconception and give targeted hint]
  H --> R
  P --> R
  N --> V[Verify mathematical result]
  V --> U[Understanding check]
  U --> G[Save progress and update dashboard]
```

## 2. Authentication And Onboarding
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  A([Open Rean AI]) --> B[Splash Screen]
  B --> C{Authenticated?}
  C -->|Yes| D{Onboarding completed?}
  C -->|No| E[Welcome Screen]
  E --> F[Sign Up: full name, email, password]
  E --> G[Sign In: email/password]
  E --> H[Google Sign-In]
  E --> I[Forgot Password -> email -> reset link -> confirmation]
  F --> J[Validate fields]
  G --> K[Validate credentials]
  H --> L[Authenticate with Google]
  J --> M[Create Firebase account]
  K --> N[Sign in]
  L --> O[Create or retrieve backend profile]
  M --> O
  N --> O
  O --> D
  D -->|No| P[Select grade, subjects, language, explanation level, optional goal]
  P --> Q[Save preferences]
  D -->|Yes| R[Open Dashboard]
  Q --> R
  J -->|Invalid/failure| X[Show clear error and allow retry]
  X --> E
```

## 3. Instant Help Entry
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  A([Tap I'm Stuck]) --> B[Open Instant Help Screen]
  B --> C[Choose input: type, photo, upload, speak, paste work, recent unfinished problem]
  C --> D[Submit problem]
  D --> E[Show immediate acknowledgement]
  D --> F[Backend creates Tutor Session]
  F --> G[Forward media/transcript/context safely]
  G --> H[AI analyzes problem in background]
  D -->|Upload/network failure| X[Retry, change input, or save draft]
  X --> C
```

## 4. Background Analysis
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  A[Analyze subject, topic, grade, language, intent, problem type, knowns, unknowns, visualization, solver, work provided, confidence] --> B{Problem clear and supported?}
  B -->|Clear and supported| C[Select safest first intervention]
  B -->|Unclear| D[Ask one short clarification question]
  D --> E[Student responds]
  E --> A
  B -->|Unsupported| F[Explain limitation, suggest related supported topic, allow rephrase]
  F --> G[Log unsupported/low-confidence case]
```

## 5. Interactive Tutor Loop
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  A[Show one short tutor message] --> B[Show matching visual or formula]
  B --> C[Ask one focused question]
  C --> D[Student responds]
  D --> E{Correct?}
  E -->|Yes| F[Concise feedback and next step]
  E -->|Partially| G[Acknowledge correct part, explain missing part, ask revise]
  E -->|No| H[Detect misconception, targeted feedback, next hint, try again]
  G --> D
  H --> D
  F --> I{Problem complete?}
  I -->|No| A
  I -->|Yes| J[Verification and understanding check]
```

## 6. Verification And Answer Reveal
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  A[AI generates step or final result] --> B[Send expression to SymPy verification]
  B --> C{Verification status}
  C -->|Verified| D[Mark Verified and show result]
  C -->|Partially verified| E[Show verified portion only and label limitation]
  C -->|Failed| F[Reject generated result and regenerate]
  F --> B
  F -->|Repeated failure| G[Safe failure message, log error, offer manual explanation or another problem]
  H[Student asks for full solution early] --> I{One more hint or complete solution?}
  I -->|Hint| A
  I -->|Complete solution| B
  D --> J[Record answer reveal when full solution shown]
  J --> K[Require follow-up understanding check]
```

## 7. Quiz Flow
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  A([Start Quiz]) --> B[Select subject/topic]
  B --> C[Select difficulty]
  C --> D[Load or generate quiz]
  D --> E[Show quiz introduction]
  E --> F[Show question]
  F --> G[Student answers, skips, flags, previous/next]
  G --> H[Save answer]
  H --> I{More questions?}
  I -->|Yes| F
  I -->|No| J[Submit quiz and confirm]
  J --> K[Evaluate answers]
  K --> L[Save attempt and update progress]
  L --> M[Show results and recommended lesson]
  D -->|Failure| X[Retry, choose another quiz, or return]
```

## 8. Voice Tutor Flow
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  A([Open Voice Tutor]) --> B[Request microphone permission]
  B --> C{Permission granted?}
  C -->|No| D[Show permission instructions, retry, or return]
  C -->|Yes| E[Record voice and stop]
  E --> F[Upload audio]
  F --> G[Speech to text]
  G --> H[Show transcript]
  H --> I{Transcript accurate?}
  I -->|No| J[Edit transcript or record again]
  J --> E
  I -->|Yes| K[Send transcript to tutor session]
  K --> L[Generate tutor response]
  L --> M[Convert response to audio]
  M --> N[Play AI voice and continue or end]
  F -->|Failure| X[Retry, type instead, or return]
```

